/bin/
# Root-level compiled binary from `go build -o diderot ./cmd/diderot`
# or a stray `go build ./cmd/...`. Anchored to root so it doesn't
# touch the cmd/diderot/ package dir or the PATH shim.
/diderot
*.test
*.out
# pgregory.net/rapid writes a reproduction file here on a local property
# test failure (e.g. internal/connector/slack's sanitize_prop_test.go);
# it's a debugging aid for whoever hit the failure, not a fixture to commit.
testdata/rapid/
.env
.env.*
!.env.quickstart.example
.claude-*
.claude/
compose.quickstart.override.yaml
# The quickstart's backup files (docs/quickstart.md); the keys archive holds
# secrets.
/diderot.dump
/diderot-keys.tar
# GoReleaser output (goreleaser release --snapshot).
/dist/
# Generated at release: the third-party licences GoReleaser packs.
/build/
